OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 14, had told friends boy    
OL,4,A'begged' to see her before being       
OL,5,Arepeatedly stabbed, murder trial hears 
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details 
OL,8,Fsome readers may find distressing      
OL,10,FA teenage girl who was stabbed to death
OL,11,Fby a 14-year-old boy told friends he   
OL,12,Fhad been "begging" to see her on the   
OL,13,Fday she was last seen alive, a murder  
OL,14,Ftrial has heard.                       
OL,16,FLilly Jones, from Blaina, in Blaenau   
OL,17,FGwent, left home at about 18:30 on 20  
OL,18,FJune, telling her father she was       
OL,19,F"popping out for a bit".               
