OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 14, had told friends boy    
OL,4,A'begged' to see her before being       
OL,5,Arepeatedly stabbed, murder trial hears 
OL,7,FThe boy, who cannot be named because of
OL,8,Fhis age, was seen on CCTV meeting Lilly
OL,9,Fnear the town's Red Lion pub that      
OL,10,Fevening. He denies her murder.         
